{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116418","id":3295921829,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Ec8al","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116418","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116418.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116418.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116418","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116418/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116418/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116418/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bea703ae12b3ffa3444ed5575f08ae36edd574d6","number":116418,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Input: Add SDL `misc2`-`misc6` gamepad button constants","user":{"login":"oCHIKIo","id":108464117,"node_id":"U_kgDOBncH9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108464117?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo","html_url":"https://github.com/oCHIKIo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Description\r\n\r\nAdds the missing MISC2 gamepad button constant to Godot's input system.\r\n\r\n## The Problem\r\n\r\nThe MISC2 button string is recognized by SDL (used by Nintendo Switch 2 Pro Controller and Horipad Steam) but was not mapped in Godot's JoyButton enum. This caused the following warning repeatedly at startup:\r\n\r\n_**Unrecognized output string \"misc2\" in mapping: 030000000d0f0000ab01000011010000,Horipad Steam,...,misc2:b2,..**_\r\n\r\nThis silently broke button support for controllers that use this button.\r\n\r\n## The Fix\r\n\r\n- Added `JoyButton::MISC2 = 21` to the enum in `core/input/input_enums.h`\r\n- Added `\"misc2\"` string at index 21 in `_joy_buttons` array in `core/input/input.cpp`\r\n- Added GDScript binding for `JOY_BUTTON_MISC2` in `core/core_constants.cpp`\r\n- Added documentation entry in `doc/classes/@GlobalScope.xml`\r\n- Updated `JoyButton::SDL_MAX` from 21 to 22\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nBuilt from source and ran with `--verbose` flag. The warning no longer appears.\r\n\r\n## Affected Hardware\r\n\r\n- Nintendo Switch 2 Pro Controller\r\n- Horipad Steam controllers","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gra